---
title: Members
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>Our members</h1>

<p>{{ club.name }} currently has approximately <strong>{{ members.count }}</strong> members.</p>

{% if members.profiles.length %}
<div class="member-grid">
  {% for member in members.profiles %}
  <div class="member-card">
    <h3>{{ member.name }}</h3>
    <p class="member-role">{{ member.role }}</p>
    <p>{{ member.bio }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p>We keep individual profiles opt-in to protect members' privacy. If
you're a member and would like a public profile here, let a Club Officer know
and we'll add you.</p>
{% endif %}
